        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romcab Puzzle</strong> is a single-player puzzle experience that blends logic, relaxation, and visual aesthetics. The game features <strong>100 cube-based levels</strong>, each designed to encourage strategic thinking and offer moments of calm and enjoyment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can tackle challenges at their own pace, accompanied by their favorite music, while exploring a wide variety of artistic styles that keep each level feeling fresh and distinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romcab is designed for both casual players and puzzle enthusiasts, with a progressive difficulty curve that ensures accessibility and challenge. There’s no pressure—just the joy of solving and advancing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 100 cube-based puzzle levels that stimulate logic and creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Diverse visual styles that bring freshness and personality to each stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 Play with your own music for a personalized experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Single-player gameplay with no competitive elements or in-app purchases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌈 Suitable for all ages: accessible, relaxing, and mentally engaging</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romcab Puzzle is where logic meets good vibes. Get ready to unwind, think, and enjoy.</p>",
